findings.proposal:
- Add _FusedXC.uks_fxc_mo. On each block:
  - rho_lowrank(Aa, Ba=Cocc_a) and rho_lowrank(Ab, Bb=Cocc_b), with the existing kernels;
  - the spin-coupled wv from fxc;
  - dot_ao_mo(wv_a, Qa=Cocc_a) and dot_ao_mo(wv_b, Qb);
  - and at the end, Ca^T(v Qa) and Cb^T(v Qb).
- Choose the path per spin with lowrank_cheaper (r = nocc of that spin).
